### Login with the test account
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200 && response.body) {
        client.global.set("access_token", response.body.accessToken);
        client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.refreshToken);
    } else {
        client.log("Request failed or returned empty body. Status: " + response.status);
    }
%}


### Get User Preferences
# Note: You must first login using auth.http to set the {{access_token}} global variable.
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Update User Preferences (Upsert)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Junie User",
  "color": "#FF5733",
  "locale": "en-US",
  "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/avatar.png"
}

### Update User Preferences (Partial/Omitted)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locale": "fr-FR"
}

### Update User Preferences (Invalid Color)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locale": "en-US",
  "color": "invalid-color"
}

### Update User Preferences (Invalid Avatar URL)
PUT http://localhost:8082/api/v1/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locale": "en-US",
  "avatarUrl": "not-a-url"
}
